
flowchart TD
    PC["Program Counter (PC)"]
    IM["Instruction Memory"]
    ADD4["PC + 4 Adder"]
    CU["Instruction Decoder and Control Unit"]
    RF["Register File (32 x 32-bit)"]
    SE["Sign Extend Immediate"]
    MUXA["ALUSrc Multiplexer"]
    ALU["ALU"]
    DM["Data Memory"]
    MUXW["MemToReg Write-back Multiplexer"]
    DST["RegDst Destination Register Multiplexer"]
    BRADD["Branch Target Adder"]
    CMP["Branch Decision (Zero)"]
    PCMUX["Next-PC Multiplexer"]
    JMP["Jump Target Generator"]

    PC -->|Instruction address| IM
    PC --> ADD4
    IM -->|Opcode and fields| CU
    IM -->|rs and rt| RF
    IM -->|Immediate| SE
    IM -->|rd and rt| DST
    CU -->|Register controls| RF
    CU -->|ALU control| ALU
    CU -->|RegDst| DST
    CU -->|ALUSrc| MUXA
    CU -->|MemRead and MemWrite| DM
    CU -->|MemToReg| MUXW
    CU -->|Branch and Jump| PCMUX

    RF -->|Read data 1| ALU
    RF -->|Read data 2| MUXA
    SE --> MUXA
    MUXA -->|Operand B| ALU

    ALU -->|ALU result / address| DM
    ALU -->|Zero flag| CMP
    RF -->|Read data 2| DM
    DM -->|Read data| MUXW
    ALU -->|ALU result| MUXW

    DST -->|Destination register| RF
    MUXW -->|Write data| RF

    ADD4 --> BRADD
    SE -->|Shift left 2| BRADD
    BRADD --> CMP
    CMP --> PCMUX
    ADD4 --> PCMUX

    IM -->|Instruction target bits| JMP
    ADD4 -->|Upper address bits| JMP
    JMP --> PCMUX
    PCMUX -->|Selected next PC| PC
